# deCDN shared devnet — developer environment template.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in YOUR basic-auth credentials. Never commit your .env.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Your basic-auth username/password are issued by the devnet operator (they are
# NOT in this repo). The shared mnemonic is also distributed out-of-band — see the
# team dev docs / README.

# ── RPC endpoint ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Foundry (cast/forge), ethers, viem, hardhat all read ETH_RPC_URL. The basic-auth
# creds go in the URL userinfo so tools authenticate transparently.
# Replace USERNAME:PASSWORD with the credentials you were given.
ETH_RPC_URL=https://USERNAME:PASSWORD@rpc-dev.decdn.org

# Same value, for tools that expect RPC_URL instead of ETH_RPC_URL.
RPC_URL=https://USERNAME:PASSWORD@rpc-dev.decdn.org

# ── Chain ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CHAIN_ID=31337

# ── Shared mnemonic ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All devs derive the SAME pre-funded accounts from this. Distributed out-of-band
# (password manager / private internal/ repo) — do NOT paste the real phrase into
# a committed file. Uncomment locally to use it with cast/forge --mnemonic.
# MNEMONIC="word word word ... word"

# ── Deployed contracts (deterministic) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Filled in once contracts are deployed; identical for every dev. See README and
# https://rpc-dev.decdn.org is fronted by the same anvil that serves these.
# DECDN_TOKEN_ADDR=0x...
# DECDN_SETTLEMENT_VAULT_ADDR=0x...
